# Controlled file delivery Ledger pattern

Read [Actions and transactions](../../references/capabilities/actions-and-transactions.md) and [Connectors](../../references/capabilities/connectors.md) before authoring this pattern; they contain the bounded controlled-file contract shipped with this Skill.

```json
{
  "handler": {
    "data_access": [{"object_key": "{{controlled_file_owner}}", "operations": ["get_for_update", "conditional_update"]}],
    "file_operations": ["verify_clean"],
    "connector_calls": [{"connection_key": "{{email_connection}}", "operation_key": "send_file_email"}]
  }
}
```

`verify_clean` semantics, `queued`≠`sent`, and `unavailable`/`manual_handoff_required` fail-closed rules are owned by the two documents above; model delivery status/evidence separately from business audit.
